# Crest: a navigation that swaps renderer views keeps the old page on screen
# until the new one draws. Crest hosts each page's view without a parent
# ui::Layer, so every RenderWidgetHostViewMac draws with its own compositor.
# The commit hides the old view, which destroyed its compositor and last
# frame, before the new view took that frame as its fallback, so the page
# showed nothing, then a bare background, before the new document painted.
# The hidden view now keeps its compositor until the task ends, and the view
# that replaces it draws with that compositor.

--- a/content/browser/renderer_host/browser_compositor_view_mac.h
+++ b/content/browser/renderer_host/browser_compositor_view_mac.h
